**Step 6: Trade-offs and Discussion**

**Trade-offs made**:
- Base62 vs Base64 (no padding issues)
- 6 characters vs longer (collision probability vs URL length)
- Database vs NoSQL (consistency vs scalability)
- Synchronous vs async analytics (accuracy vs speed)

**Scaling considerations**:
- Read replicas for redirects
- Shard by shortCode first character
- CDN for geo-distribution
- Eventual consistency for analytics

